{"seq":4,"slug":"video-encoding","title":"视频编码","stage":"DONE","category":"photography-video","categoryLabel":"摄影与视频","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/photography-video/video-encoding","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":2.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.15,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 视频编码 简介\n\n视频编码（Video Encoding）是将原始视频数据压缩为可传输和存储的格式的技术体系。从每秒数十 GB 的无压缩 RAW 到几 Mbps 的流媒体码流，编码技术在\"质量保留\"与\"体积压缩\"之间进行精密的数学博弈。本 Hub 覆盖视频基础参数、压缩编解码器（H.264/H.265/AV1）、容器封装格式、以及流媒体分发技术。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"video-fundamentals","title":"视频基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/photography-video/video-encoding/video-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"frame-rate","title":"帧率与时间基准","url":"/h/photography-video/video-encoding/video-fundamentals/frame-rate","wordCount":1120,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"resolution","title":"分辨率与像素密度","url":"/h/photography-video/video-encoding/video-fundamentals/resolution","wordCount":977,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"scan-methods","title":"扫描方式与场序","url":"/h/photography-video/video-encoding/video-fundamentals/scan-methods","wordCount":1082,"readingTime":5}],"introMarkdown":"# 视频基础 简介\n\n视频基础覆盖帧率、分辨率、扫描方式等决定视频特性的核心参数。这些参数在拍摄前确定、编码时固化、播放时还原——理解它们是后续压缩和分发技术的前提。\n"},{"seq":2,"slug":"compression-codecs","title":"压缩编码","docCount":3,"url":"/h/photography-video/video-encoding/compression-codecs","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"h264-h265","title":"H.264/H.265 编码架构","url":"/h/photography-video/video-encoding/compression-codecs/h264-h265","wordCount":1123,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"av1","title":"AV1 编码与开放标准","url":"/h/photography-video/video-encoding/compression-codecs/av1","wordCount":1160,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"intra-inter-compression","title":"帧间帧内压缩原理","url":"/h/photography-video/video-encoding/compression-codecs/intra-inter-compression","wordCount":1267,"readingTime":6}],"introMarkdown":"# 压缩编码 简介\n\n压缩编码是视频技术的核心——它利用帧内空间冗余和帧间时间冗余，将数据量压缩 $100–1000$ 倍而保持视觉上的无损或近无损。本章覆盖从 H.264 到 AV1 的主流编解码器架构、帧类型系统、以及率失真优化原理。\n"},{"seq":3,"slug":"container-formats","title":"容器格式","docCount":3,"url":"/h/photography-video/video-encoding/container-formats","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mp4-mov","title":"MP4 与 MOV 容器格式","url":"/h/photography-video/video-encoding/container-formats/mp4-mov","wordCount":2072,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"mkv","title":"MKV 容器格式与 Matroska 生态","url":"/h/photography-video/video-encoding/container-formats/mkv","wordCount":2199,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"muxing-streams","title":"封装与流管理","url":"/h/photography-video/video-encoding/container-formats/muxing-streams","wordCount":2014,"readingTime":9}],"introMarkdown":"# 容器格式 简介\n\n容器格式（Container Format）是将编码后的视频流、音频流、字幕流和元数据\"封装\"为一个文件的格式规范。MP4、MKV、MOV 等容器各有设计哲学和适用场景。本章解析主流容器的结构、流（Stream）管理机制、以及格式选择策略。\n"},{"seq":4,"slug":"streaming-delivery","title":"流媒体分发","docCount":3,"url":"/h/photography-video/video-encoding/streaming-delivery","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"adaptive-bitrate","title":"自适应码率流媒体技术","url":"/h/photography-video/video-encoding/streaming-delivery/adaptive-bitrate","wordCount":1891,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"cdn","title":"CDN 加速与视频分发架构","url":"/h/photography-video/video-encoding/streaming-delivery/cdn","wordCount":2085,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"low-latency-live","title":"低延迟直播技术","url":"/h/photography-video/video-encoding/streaming-delivery/low-latency-live","wordCount":2098,"readingTime":9}],"introMarkdown":"# 流媒体分发 简介\n\n流媒体分发（Streaming Delivery）解决\"如何将视频实时传输到全球观众\"的工程问题。从自适应码率（ABR）到 CDN 加速，从低延迟直播到 WebRTC 实时通信，本章覆盖视频在网络上的传输协议、质量自适应机制和基础设施架构。\n"}]}